<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-06T21:41:17.445Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 21:41:17 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces maintain a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the strategic al-Jawf mountain range, intensifying front-line fighting. The coalition downed a Houthi ballistic missile aimed at Medina and intercepted another long-range anti-tank guided missile that struck a Saudi-backed vehicle, wounding a fighter. A market strike in southwestern Yemen killed at least 20 civilians, and a missile attack on an oil tanker in the Gulf killed a sailor. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/05/yemen-president-sacks-ministers-and-officers-houthis&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQX2dnUGl1aW80ME5NMmhGWnZqLThHcjYwem9KMnVOUVlqQmM4XzNiemlVOWhMTGJ1MFNqNGZacmlMNnNab3dicnNnREtRLVA5bjdONV9yV1pEVXlPTW5jaGpBNDNCS3NVeFUxYUQzdWt6SHgyVE9aZnl3ZlZEN0I4RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQQ29uc0tzMWxmM2ZTVWxyb2UwakhsVmVyTU5BWlFQNzVyTG9GYlFzWHl6QWR2NnFVM2pJc3F0OWdJQmRIdm9GekdzNWM2NU1DblJENUEydlRlbk5KZDE0dURyMDB5UG4xNmdMMnZrZ1VvZ0hIRml6QVZwR1RMZm03QUpSaF85ZGVDRXFmeXdvcjFBXzFDOHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOY1FVSTZkUVFvMjlJdFBFMWdVaVVMQzZMX0t5cHplZUplTlYtaDRvVlFyLXFQSzNUUW9ObUYyb2p1ZlFEdVZUeE9TVEdTV0RPakNkbW80VVNKOXAtQUIzQXU1bHZXWVhNZGpEVkhfVE5qMlhaczlwdzNNVk93WmdxNFY3SU82SVp5eTBsaWxCRUpvRTE3RkdDSXotR1hTYlByOGpRZ1h5YmNDOUk4Ymhz?oc=5&quot;&gt;KSL News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTFB2LVR